{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20119","headline":"送孟寂赴举 · 孟郊","name":"送孟寂赴举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烈士不忧身，爲君吟苦辛。\n男儿久失意，宝剑亦生尘。\n浮俗官是贵，君子道所珍。\n况当圣明主，岂乏证玉臣。\n浊水无白日，清流鉴苍旻。\n贤愚皎然别，结交当有因。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20119.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20119","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}